't produce heat.\nSo, choice (C) is incorrect.\n(D): This choice suggests that shining a light through a diamond would make a lot of money.\nWhile diamonds are valuable and highly sought after, the act of shining a light through a diamond doesn't directly generate wealth.\nThe value of a diamond comes from its rarity, beauty, and market demand, not from the light passing through it.", "specificity_preds": [3, 1, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 3, 2, 0, 1, 1, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 3, 2], "specificity_probs": [[0.033936772495508194, 0.04937771335244179, 0.023324379697442055, 0.8752408623695374], [0.006684335879981518, 0.6818207502365112, 0.22135479748249054, 0.08143188059329987], [0.01474495604634285, 0.018932897597551346, 0.9122381210327148, 0.0454176627099514], [0.5470930933952332, 0.3318287432193756, 0.01872049644589424, 0.09507051855325699], [0.004815435968339443, 0.004249607678502798, 0.9768436551094055, 0.007458292879164219], [0.004760567098855972, 0.01768765226006508, 0.9657130837440491, 0.00327188684605062], [0.766355037689209, 0.09152805805206299, 0.10371487587690353, 0.033671289682388306], [0.07007865607738495, 0.07940952479839325, 0.31407076120376587, 0.5178151726722717], [0.015198979526758194, 0.02505888231098652, 0.9403275847434998, 0.008135427720844746], [0.43803825974464417, 0.3865674138069153, 0.11075341701507568, 0.059282030910253525], [0.0006885473849251866, 0.969546914100647, 0.020122302696108818, 0.002898892853409052], [0.12228738516569138, 0.548054039478302, 0.20161782205104828, 0.12228738516569138], [0.004761800169944763, 0.31360238790512085, 0.006508610211312771, 0.6638962626457214], [0.23724496364593506, 0.23724496364593506, 0.3046285808086395, 0.20936794579029083], [0.048703115433454514, 0.03347312659025192, 0.8632833361625671, 0.048703115433454514], [0.03729948028922081, 0.04226584732532501, 0.06149645149707794, 0.8489322662353516], [0.0025811903178691864, 0.002924871863797307, 0.9782357215881348, 0.004822298418730497], [0.28298184275627136, 0.012433354742825031,